01:02:54,552 --> 01:02:58,168
We didn't talk about it?

890
01:02:58,374 --> 01:03:02,993
When Jihad(جهاد) is Fard Ain(فرض عين) does it become Fard Ain(فرض عين) on women or not?

891
01:03:03,438 --> 01:03:04,397
We didn't talk about it.?

892
01:03:04,484 --> 01:03:05,865
We didn't!

893
01:03:06,595 --> 01:03:11,296
But anyway, according to the Mad'hab(مذهب) of Ibn Nuhas(إبن نُحاس) and Mazd'hab(مذهب) of As-Shafie(ألشَّافعي),

894
01:03:11,348 --> 01:03:13,856
that when Jihad(جهاد) become Fard Ain(فرض عين) on the community,

895
01:03:13,919 --> 01:03:16,404
it becomes Fard Ain(فرض عين) also on women if they're able to fight.

896
01:03:16,705 --> 01:03:21,456
And because Fard Ain(فرض عين) on them, so the rules of Fard Ain(فرض عين) apply to them, which means

897
01:03:22,025 --> 01:03:23,721
she doesn't have to take permission from the husband.

898
01:03:26,485 --> 01:03:33,439
If she has a martial art sister or something than, it needs to just go regardless of what the husband thinks.

899
01:03:36,584 --> 01:03:44,584
The parents should be treated in the best manner, best way however, without compromising the Faroodh Ul-Ayad(فروض الآياد),

900
01:03:46,086 --> 01:03:47,073
Fard Ain(فرض عين) is Fard Ain(فرض عين).

901
01:03:47,434 --> 01:03:54,383
One of the brother said: I think, he was mentioning that one of the scholars was mentioning something like that,

902
01:03:55,869 --> 01:04:04,259
if we didn't disobey our parents, none of us would have fight Jihad(جهاد).

903
01:04:05,170 --> 01:04:08,728
So disobeying the parents is this, is obeying Allah!!!

904
01:04:10,979 --> 01:04:14,283
But this should not carry spill over to other aspects.

905
01:04:14,557 --> 01:04:19,334
Yani(يعني) it should be limited to that because the thing is, this would cause some complications.

906
01:04:20,156 --> 01:04:22,799
Disobeying them in this, would cause complications.

907
01:04:23,164 --> 01:04:29,141
And what could happen is? One could use that as an excuse to blow up the affair even further.

908
01:04:29,314 --> 01:04:32,669
No, it should be restricted to that and the relationship with the parents

909
01:04:32,784 --> 01:04:37,166
